## Error Handling Protocol

**CRITICAL: Fix things at the CAUSE, not the symptom.**

READ THE ERROR MESSAGE

Quote it exactly
Identify what stage failed


DIAGNOSE BEFORE PRESCRIBING

List possible causes
Rank by likelihood
State your diagnosis with evidence


ONE FIX AT A TIME

Attempt ONE fix
Test if resolved
If NOT resolved: UNDO immediately
Re-analyze with new information


NEVER STACK UNTESTED FIXES

Each fix must be validated
No "let's also try this while we're at it"




---

## Quality Imperatives

### DO
✅ Complete, idiomatic code - no TODOs or placeholders  
✅ Run tests after every change  
✅ Ask before major decisions  
✅ Provide exact verification commands  
✅ Explain what you're doing and why  

### DO NOT
❌ Proceed without plan approval  
❌ Stack multiple untested fixes  
❌ Use print() for logging in production code  
❌ Leave hardcoded values  
❌ Block with synchronous I/O in async code  

