## Quick Commands

| Say | Agent Action |
|-----|--------------|
| "Continue" | Resume from workflow_state.md |
| "Status" | Report current phase and blockers |
| "Plan [feature]" | Enter BLUEPRINT, draft plan |
| "Approve" | Move BLUEPRINT → CONSTRUCT |
| "Done" | Move to VALIDATE |
| "Reset" | Clear task, return to BLUEPRINT |
| "Explain [concept]" | Teach with examples |

